    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>It\u2019s Raining Acorn!</i>\u2014an idle pachinko drafting game where strategy meets nature in a beautifully crafted, vertically scrolling forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It sits on the side of your desktop and you can leave it running while you work, but good luck focusing when you see those acorns bounce, roll, and trigger satisfying combos across your custom-built forest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pachinko-Style Fun</strong>: Place, tweak, and upgrade your pieces to create the most efficient acorn-catching setup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440980/extras/7ce9fcecee4e3d4e1ac270b96c53c14d.poster.avif?t=1739507908\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440980/extras/7ce9fcecee4e3d4e1ac270b96c53c14d.webm?t=1739507908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440980/extras/7ce9fcecee4e3d4e1ac270b96c53c14d.mp4?t=1739507908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle with a Twist</strong>: Unlike typical idle games, this one won\u2019t let you completely forget about it. The falling acorns, playful animals, and bouncing balls are just too satisfying to ignore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440980/extras/d5b4b5d27ea7ddcfedf4056e7ab57d3b.poster.avif?t=1739507908\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440980/extras/d5b4b5d27ea7ddcfedf4056e7ab57d3b.webm?t=1739507908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440980/extras/d5b4b5d27ea7ddcfedf4056e7ab57d3b.mp4?t=1739507908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dynamic, Living World</strong>: Mix and match animals, plants, and landscapes to create a vibrant ecosystem that\u2019s always evolving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440980/extras/aca89469d90f6171a89b57deb54dbc3f.poster.avif?t=1739507908\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440980/extras/aca89469d90f6171a89b57deb54dbc3f.webm?t=1739507908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440980/extras/aca89469d90f6171a89b57deb54dbc3f.mp4?t=1739507908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fits Right into Your Screen (Or Not)</strong>: Built to sit unobtrusively on the side of your your screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Yet Hard to Resist</strong>: Don\u2019t be deceived by it\u2019s relaxing vibes, the game is cleverly designed to make it hard to stop playing once you start.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>It\u2019s Raining Acorn!</i>\u2014an idle pachinko drafting game where strategy meets nature in a beautifully crafted, vertically scrolling forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It sits on the side of your desktop and you can leave it running while you work, but good luck focusing when you see those acorns bounce, roll, and trigger satisfying combos across your custom-built forest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pachinko-Style Fun</strong>: Place, tweak, and upgrade your pieces to create the most efficient acorn-catching setup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440980/extras/7ce9fcecee4e3d4e1ac270b96c53c14d.poster.avif?t=1739507908\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440980/extras/7ce9fcecee4e3d4e1ac270b96c53c14d.webm?t=1739507908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440980/extras/7ce9fcecee4e3d4e1ac270b96c53c14d.mp4?t=1739507908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle with a Twist</strong>: Unlike typical idle games, this one won\u2019t let you completely forget about it. The falling acorns, playful animals, and bouncing balls are just too satisfying to ignore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440980/extras/d5b4b5d27ea7ddcfedf4056e7ab57d3b.poster.avif?t=1739507908\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440980/extras/d5b4b5d27ea7ddcfedf4056e7ab57d3b.webm?t=1739507908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440980/extras/d5b4b5d27ea7ddcfedf4056e7ab57d3b.mp4?t=1739507908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dynamic, Living World</strong>: Mix and match animals, plants, and landscapes to create a vibrant ecosystem that\u2019s always evolving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440980/extras/aca89469d90f6171a89b57deb54dbc3f.poster.avif?t=1739507908\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440980/extras/aca89469d90f6171a89b57deb54dbc3f.webm?t=1739507908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440980/extras/aca89469d90f6171a89b57deb54dbc3f.mp4?t=1739507908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fits Right into Your Screen (Or Not)</strong>: Built to sit unobtrusively on the side of your your screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Yet Hard to Resist</strong>: Don\u2019t be deceived by it\u2019s relaxing vibes, the game is cleverly designed to make it hard to stop playing once you start.</p></li></ul>",
